{"created": "2026-09-14T14:08:10.024847+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-14T14:08:10.333544+00:00", "id": 22750727, "conceptrecid": "22750726", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22750726", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "metadata": {"title": "Nonunique indecomposable projective decompositions over the localized group ring of PSL2(F11)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "publication_date": "2026-09-14", "description": "<p>Put \\(O=\\mathbb Z_{(11)}\\) and \\(G=\\operatorname{PSL}_2(\\mathbb F_{11})\\). We construct nonzero finitely generated indecomposable projective \\(O[G]\\)-modules \\(A,B,C,D\\), each of \\(O\\)-rank \\(44\\), with \\[A\\oplus D\\cong B\\oplus C,\\qquad A\\not\\cong B,\\qquad A\\not\\cong C.\\] Thus a projective module of rank \\(88\\) has two inequivalent decompositions into indecomposable projectives, giving a negative answer to Kourovka Problem 4.55. Three of the modules are summands of representations induced from subgroups of orders \\(12\\) and \\(60\\). Their \\(11\\)-adic completions split into pairs of projective covers. Irrational character values prevent either member of a pair from descending separately to \\(O\\), while approximation of homomorphisms descends the required complementary summand.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jayadevan, Achyuth", "affiliation": "Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE", "orcid": "0009-0008-8745-4078"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Achxy/k-4-55", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "lean", "title": {"en": "Lean"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22750726"}}]}}, "title": "Nonunique indecomposable projective decompositions over the localized group ring of PSL2(F11)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22750727", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22750727?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22750727", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750726", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22750726", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22750726", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22750726", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22750727:kourovka-4-55-paper.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22750727/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22750727/versions", "draft": "ht